graph TD
    Start([Self-Improvement Cycle Triggered]) --> Analysis[SelfAnalysisAgent<br/>Analyze Codebase]
    
    Analysis --> Health[CodeHealthMonitor<br/>Evaluate Health Score]
    Analysis --> Drift[ArchitectureDriftDetector<br/>Detect Drift]
    Analysis --> Opportunities[FeatureOpportunityFinder<br/>Find Opportunities]
    
    Health --> Architect[ArchitectAgent<br/>Design Improvements]
    Drift --> Architect
    Opportunities --> Architect
    
    Architect --> CTO[CTOAgent<br/>Review & Approve]
    
    CTO -->|Approved| Engineer[EngineerAgent<br/>Generate Patches]
    CTO -->|Rejected| EndReject([Cycle Ended<br/>CTO Rejected])
    
    Engineer --> ImpactGuard[ImpactGuard<br/>Validate Changes]
    
    ImpactGuard -->|ZERO_IMPACT| SuggestionsOnly([Suggestions Only<br/>No Changes Applied])
    ImpactGuard -->|CONTROLLED_IMPACT| ValidateTests[Run Tests<br/>Generate Patch Diff]
    ImpactGuard -->|FULL_IMPACT| ValidateApproval[Supervisor Approval]
    
    ValidateTests --> TestsPass{Tests Pass?}
    TestsPass -->|Yes| QA[QAAgent<br/>Generate Test Updates]
    TestsPass -->|No| WarnTests([Warning:<br/>Tests Failed])
    
    ValidateApproval --> Supervisor[SupervisorAgent<br/>Final Approval]
    QA --> Supervisor
    
    Supervisor -->|Approved| Apply[Apply Safe Changes<br/>via Code Tools]
    Supervisor -->|Rejected| EndReject
    
    Apply --> Commit[GitCommitTool<br/>Commit Changes]
    
    Commit --> Log[Log All Changes<br/>Audit Trail]
    
    Log --> EndSuccess([Cycle Completed<br/>Improvements Applied])
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style EndSuccess fill:#d4edda
    style EndReject fill:#f8d7da
    style SuggestionsOnly fill:#fff3cd
    style WarnTests fill:#fff3cd



